Z||000003||RiceCooker||06-30-2000||01:53 PM||||OK, here's the scoop.<P>It's the USA Today Football Challenge and the site is at <A HREF="http://www.cdmsports.com/usa/football" TARGET=_blank>www.cdmsports.com/usa/football</A> <BR>It's 29.95 per team if entered before July 12. You can request to be in the same league (25 teams) to make it more interesting but you have to send them together. Anyone who is interested can e-mail me then i will fax you the info, roster, rules, etc. You can mail the stuff back to me and i can send it in all together for everyone who is interested.<BR>I'm at fieromanbiff@hotmail.com<P>Oh yeah, Grand prize is $25,000.00<P>See you in the endzone!||||reg||1
